title: 社会主义就是野蛮!
subtitle: 资产阶级抛出了他们最新的诽谤……
tags: event
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
view-if: capital_strike_seen and (class_war*capital_strike_progress) >= (bourgeois_power*100)

= 社会主义就是野蛮!

最近,一本新小册子正在[? if not socialized_media : 资产阶级报刊上 ?][? if socialized_media : 资产阶级圈子里 ?]流传 —— 它是资本罢工开始以来涌现的众多小册子中最新的一本。它恶毒攻击社会主义,指控我们搞极权主义、反自然,并从哲学与他们那套所谓的经济学出发宣称:社会应有的构造方式,是让每个个体在自由市场上凭才能竞争。

这本小册子本身绝无特别之处;特别的是资产阶级如今反对我们事业的那份绝望 —— 他们竟为这本平庸的诽谤小册子动用了手头的一切工具,企图靠污蔑把这场革命抹掉。

- @pathetic: 他们的图谋当然都是徒劳。
- @worrying: 事态令人相当担忧。

@worrying
view-if: not socialized_media
on-arrival: {!

Q.new_middle_spd *= (0.5+(0.5*(Q.socialism/100)));
Q.old_middle_spd *= (0.5+(0.5*(Q.socialism/100)))
Q.rural_spd *= (0.5+(0.5*(Q.socialism/100)))
Q.catholics_spd *= (0.5+(0.5*(Q.socialism/100)))
Q.unemployed_spd *= (1-((Q.socialism/100)*0.1));
Q.workers_spd *= (1-((Q.socialism/100)*0.1));

Q.socialism -= (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
Q.coup_progress += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(Q.spd_normalized+Q.kpd_normalized))/2;

if (Q.capital_nazi) {
    Q.workers_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))/2;
    Q.new_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
    Q.old_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
    Q.rural_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
    Q.bourgeoisie_dvp += (2*Q.capital_strike_progress);
    if (!Q.dnvp_banned) {
        Q.workers_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))/2;
        Q.new_middle_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
        Q.old_middle_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
        Q.rural_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
        Q.bourgeoisie_dnvp += Q.capital_strike_progress;
    }
    if (Q.dnvp_banned) {
        Q.workers_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))/2;
        Q.new_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
        Q.old_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
        Q.rural_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/2;
    }
}
if (!Q.capital_nazi) {
    Q.workers_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))*1.5;
    Q.new_middle_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)*1.5;
    Q.old_middle_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)*1.5;
    Q.rural_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)*1.5;
    Q.bourgeoisie_nsdap += (3*Q.capital_strike_progress);
}

!}

不幸的是,这是个相当令人担忧的动向。既然资产阶级仍掌控着全德国的报纸与印刷厂,哪怕这本小册子再荒唐,它也很可能影响舆论。

@pathetic
view-if: socialized_media
on-arrival: {!

Q.new_middle_spd *= (0.75+(0.25*(Q.socialism/100)));
Q.old_middle_spd *= (0.75+(0.25*(Q.socialism/100)))
Q.rural_spd *= (0.75+(0.25*(Q.socialism/100)))
Q.catholics_spd *= (0.75+(0.25*(Q.socialism/100)))
Q.unemployed_spd *= (1-((Q.socialism/100)*0.05));
Q.workers_spd *= (1-((Q.socialism/100)*0.05));

Q.socialism -= (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
Q.coup_progress += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(Q.spd_normalized+Q.kpd_normalized))/4;

if (Q.capital_nazi) {
    Q.workers_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))/4;
    Q.new_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
    Q.old_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
    Q.rural_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
    Q.bourgeoisie_dvp += (2*Q.capital_strike_progress);
    if (!Q.dnvp_banned) {
        Q.workers_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))/4;
        Q.new_middle_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
        Q.old_middle_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
        Q.rural_dnvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
        Q.bourgeoisie_dnvp += Q.capital_strike_progress;
    }
    if (Q.dnvp_banned) {
        Q.workers_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))/4;
        Q.new_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
        Q.old_middle_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
        Q.rural_dvp += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)/4;
    }
}
if (!Q.capital_nazi) {
    Q.workers_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power*(1-(Q.socialism/100)))*0.75;
    Q.new_middle_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)*0.75;
    Q.old_middle_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)*0.75;
    Q.rural_nsdap += (Q.capital_strike_progress*Q.bourgeois_power)*0.75;
    Q.bourgeoisie_nsdap += (3*Q.capital_strike_progress);
}

!}

由于我们已把报纸与印刷厂社会化,资产阶级借这类小册子对舆论施加的影响已大为减弱。不过,这场协同行动仍造成了一定伤害 —— 至少是在较为资产阶级化的群体中。